{"repositoryId":54041620,"availability":"available","full":"matthiasn/lotti","name":"lotti","description":"A private logbook with a staff of personal AI assistants. Agents read what you record and propose what to do next — you approve the changes. End-to-end encrypted sync between your own devices — servers only ever see ciphertext. Local AI optional.","category":"Productivity","language":"Dart","stars":1200,"forks":120,"created":"2016-03-16T15:01:59Z","updated":"2026-10-16T13:01:48Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://matthiasn.github.io/lotti/","topics":["agentic","agentic-ai","agentic-workflow","ai","ai-agents","android-app","end-to-end-encryption","flutter","health","ios","journaling","linux-app","local-first","macos","matrix","privacy","speech-recognition","task-management","task-manager","time-tracker"],"demo":"https://matthiasn.github.io/lotti/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","stars":1200,"forks":120}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Come say hi on Discord — questions, support, ideas, or just what you are using Lotti for.","A distributed system of record for your memories — kept on your devices, and nowhere else.","Everything you capture in Lotti is a memory: a voice note, a screenshot, a conversation, a photo from a birthday party, an hour of focused work, the journal entry you spoke into your phone last night. Lotti keeps those memories on your own devices and syncs them between those devices with end-to-end encryption; no cloud ever holds a readable copy. On top of that record sit applications — tasks, relationships, goals, events, projects, a daily journal — most of them looked after by a personal AI agent that reads what you recorded and proposes what to do next. Agents propose; you decide. Your…"],"features":["Audio recording anywhere in the app, transcribed locally with Whisper","(99 languages) or Voxtral, or through a cloud provider with audio support.","Entries: notes, images, screenshots, measurements, and surveys, attached","to the work, person, event or day they belong to.","Tasks with full lifecycle (open, groomed, in progress, blocked, on hold,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f1af8fe7ff81bac86acad768de53311e56bc51ecb1052376d3e15e17c354f6b4","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Come say hi on Discord — questions, support, ideas, or just what you are using Lotti for.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"tools/matrixprovisioner CLI or the optional provisioning service, which create the sync account and encrypted room and produce a single-use pairing bundle.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"The other side of that: there is no server-side backup and no account recovery, because no server holds a readable or lasting copy of your data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The one thing it does not include is hosted sync infrastructure — running a homeserver is a real cost, so you either self-host Matrix or bring your own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f1af8fe7ff81bac86acad768de53311e56bc51ecb1052376d3e15e17c354f6b4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthiasn/lotti/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T13:19:42.418Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T13:01:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourc